---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Enterprise DPP Software License | On-Premise & Private Cloud | EU DPP Provider"
  description="Procure independent Enterprise DPP software licensing for complete data sovereignty, custom ERP/MES/BMS integrations, and unlimited battery serialization."
>
  <div class="py-16 bg-radial-gradient">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold font-mono text-brand-400 uppercase tracking-widest bg-brand-500/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-brand-500/20">
          Independent Software License
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight mt-4 mb-6">
          Enterprise DPP Software Suite: 100% Data Sovereignty
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          Designed for tier-1 cell manufacturers, gigafactories, and automotive groups requiring on-premise or dedicated private cloud Kubernetes cluster deployment. Own your software stack, maintain absolute control over proprietary trade secrets, and scale with zero per-passport metering penalties.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Comparison Grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 my-16">
        
        <div class="glass-card p-8 border border-slate-800 space-y-4">
          <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-brand-400">DEPLOYMENT ARCHITECTURE</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Private Cloud & On-Premise Kubernetes</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Deploy via Helm Charts or Terraform across AWS, Azure, Google Cloud, Alibaba Cloud, or on-premise air-gapped bare metal.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-300 pt-2 border-t border-slate-800">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ Full physical data isolation (No multi-tenant mixing)</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ Open REST API & GraphQL endpoints for internal ERP</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ Compatible with Catena-X Eclipse Dataspace Connector (EDC)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="glass-card p-8 border border-slate-800 space-y-4">
          <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-accent-emerald">UNLIMITED SERIALIZATION</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Zero Per-Passport Overages</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Generate and manage millions of battery passports per year without variable per-unit SaaS taxes. Ideal for high-throughput Giga-scale production lines.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-300 pt-2 border-t border-slate-800">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ High-speed batch GS1 QR code generation (120+ packs/min)</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ Automated PEFCR LCA Carbon Footprint computation module</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ Dedicated technical support and annual upgrade SLA</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Architecture Diagram Callout -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Enterprise Software Capabilities Checklist</h3>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-xs pt-2">
          <div class="p-4 bg-slate-950 rounded-xl border border-slate-800">
            <div class="font-bold text-white mb-1">PCF Carbon Calculator</div>
            <p class="text-slate-400">Pre-built Ecoinvent & GaBi database mapping for instant cradle-to-gate battery carbon accounting.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-slate-950 rounded-xl border border-slate-800">
            <div class="font-bold text-white mb-1">Due Diligence Vault</div>
            <p class="text-slate-400">OECD 5-step framework management for Cobalt, Lithium, Nickel, and Graphite provenance audits.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-slate-950 rounded-xl border border-slate-800">
            <div class="font-bold text-white mb-1">GS1 Digital Link Resolver</div>
            <p class="text-slate-400">Internal URI redirection server returning JSON-LD to machines and responsive HTML to consumers.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class="mt-16 text-center space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Request Software Trial & Architecture Whitepaper</h3>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-brand-500 text-white font-bold text-sm hover:opacity-90">
          Request Enterprise Software License &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
